Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:48.12,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}He's standing right in your shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:51.91,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}And you feel like you're in his too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.11,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}When did he show up right next to you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:59.50,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}How strange that you should only notice now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:02.06,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}The hero you thought was gone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:06.09,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Distant memory of a past life
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:09.20,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}He's back in force and he's leading the way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:12.55,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Has something changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:18.25,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}It's an inner strength you find hard to define
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:19.21,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}But now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:21.55,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}It's here somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:23.76,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Maybe this is your …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.05,0:03:26.47,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Chance to Move On
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:30.11,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Rise up with the Dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:34.12,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Stop could be your big win
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:36.04,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}It's right there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:38.01,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}For you to grab your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:40.66,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Chance to become
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:44.20,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Whatever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:47.66,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Next Chance to Move On
