Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.77,0:23:14.46,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}If I tell
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.71,0:23:17.22,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}you show me how to love?
