Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.16,0:23:23.80,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}在那笨拙的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.05,0:23:29.40,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}仰望你耀眼的微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.66,0:23:34.13,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}被染上樱色
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.70,0:23:37.03,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3\an2}I just say
